# Ruling: if an opponent already cast a noncreature spell the turn the Queen enters, that was its first one and she does not
# trigger for that opponent that turn. Turn 3, Bot1's turn: Bot2 answers Bot1's Mox Jet with Lightning Bolt (its first noncreature
# spell of the turn), then Bot1 casts the Queen, and Bot2's second Lightning Bolt after she is in play is not the first, so Bot1
# does not recruit (library untouched, no Soldier). The scenario the-queen-of-dale-recruits-only-for-an-opponents-first-noncreature-
# spell-each-turn shows the first noncreature spell after she is in play does trigger.

